{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0453_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "dcb16a3ed07a90cd886a44663c0b008fdaac5264d086bcea4508bc5a4c7f7cee", "ja": "小さい頃、この歌を聞いて寝ると、\n朝までぐっすりだったって、母ちゃんが言っててねぇ。", "zh": "妈妈跟我说过，小时候只要听着这首歌入睡，\n就能一觉睡到大天亮呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
