{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_035hin0453_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_035hin0453_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c84cedfa0b3e6bd33c4180a622620478f0cab51aa1ee597ddfcec2710ce6f43e", "ja": "熟睡できる子守唄か……。\n今日の撮影にぴったりなエピソードだな。", "zh": "能让人熟睡的摇篮曲吗……\n这真是个适合今天拍摄的故事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
